  "details": "I have a friend that is incapable of handling sexual content of any kind due to PTSD and the user interface for VRChat is NOT friendly about this. There's frequently scantily clad characters everywhere. \n\nI would like to request better user interface for this stuff, and a broader variety of, and enforced-necessity to tag content, including \"general\", \"suggestive\", and \"adult\" levels -- because very frequently he runs into content that is not strictly-NSFW but enough to trigger him that a tag like 'suggestive' would help with.\n\nParticularly, crowd-sourced tagging like steam does for games might help.",
